## 2. Website Schema Structure Planning

Create WebSite schema structure including:

Required properties:

- @context
- @type
- name
- url


Additional properties:

- description
- publisher
- potentialAction
- inLanguage
- copyrightYear
- sameAs
- about


For each property analyze:

{
  "property": "",
  "value": "",
  "required": "",
  "seo_importance": ""
}


